                                "example_id": "3c564b38-83d9-49c0-9825-c9e7a677f4e3",
                                "sense_id": "16a414af-3ee9-33a7-a5fa-4de58fe04239",
                                "text": "[…] she had had glimpses enough of the scene: of the audience of bright elderly women, with snowy hair, eurythmic movements, and finely-wrinkled over-massaged faces on which a smile of glassy benevolence sat like their rimless pince-nez. They were all inexorably earnest, aimlessly kind and fathomlessly pure […]"
                            },
                            {
